<title>JAPAN: Honda - 3qtr group results (SEC).</title>
<headline>Honda - 3qtr group results (SEC).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.33 trln	 vs	    1.02 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  100.59		vs	   34.56</p>
<p> Pretax		96.82		vs	   25.86</p>
<p> Net		   61.92		vs	   18.36</p>
<p> EPS		   63.54 yen	  vs	   18.84 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Honda Motor Co Ltd is a leading car and motorcycle manufacturer. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
